@startuml
title HCP-D02 HikCentral Authentication Boundary
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Central PMS\nplatform service identity" as Central
component "HikCentral connector\ntrust boundary" as Connector
database "Approved secret channel\n(no secrets in repo/docs/logs)" as Secrets
component "HCP OpenAPI boundary\nsigned request integration" as HCP
component "Audit / Event\nredacted records" as Audit

Central --> Connector : service-to-service trust
Connector --> Secrets : retrieve credential at runtime
Connector --> HCP : signed API request
HCP --> Connector : vendor response
Connector --> Audit : redacted security + outcome facts

note bottom
HCP credentials are not platform authority.
No AppKey/AppSecret, AK/SK, signature, or auth header values are documented.
end note
@enduml
